<title>USA: Emerson enters Daewoo alliance.</title>
<headline>Emerson enters Daewoo alliance.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emerson Radio Corp said on Tuesday that it has reached a four-year agreement for the sale of Emerson Radio branded products made by Daewoo Electronics Co for the U.S. market.</p>
<p>The agreement provides that Emerson will handle all sales and marketing of the Emerson TV and video products to U.S. retailers while Daewoo will be responsible for all aspects of product development and manufacturing as well as after-sales services, Emerson said.</p>
<p>Emerson will be compensated based on net sales of such products and the earnings benefit of the sales will be recorded as an income item, it said.</p>
<p>Emerson said its growing international business, increased acceptance of its home theater product and savings from improved coordination with Sport Supply Group Inc could lead to a profitable fiscal year.</p>
</text>
